Game data. mod/LockPickHelper/Script/LockPickHelper/LockGraphs.as, tools/oracle/locks_data.lua,
mod/LockPickHelper/Script/LockPickHelper/UnitTests/GoldenSolver.as and tests/fixtures/* contain
lock layouts, and data derived from them, from Gothic 1 Remake; the first two are generated from
the sources of the G1R-Modkit by tools/gen_lockgraphs.py. They are not covered by this license;
the game and its data belong to their rights holders.
